# Backend Node + MySQL (jika di-set, dipakai menggantikan Supabase untuk auth & sync data)
# Hanya origin. Jangan akhiri dengan /api atau /api/v1 (path ganda → 404 di APK).
# Jika PWA Anda di www dan APK pakai apex (atau sebaliknya), app akan otomatis mencoba host lain hanya saat respons 404.
# Opsional jarang: VITE_API_PATH_PREFIX=/api/v1 (default)
# Lokal: http://localhost:8787 | Docker Compose (default): http://localhost:8788 (API di-map ke 8788)
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8787

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-publishable-key
# Backward-compatible fallback:
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key
# --- Server AI (server/.env) — prioritas Vertex AI ---
# VERTEX_PROJECT_ID=your-gcp-project-id
# VERTEX_LOCATION=us-central1
# VERTEX_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash-001
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=C:\path\to\service-account.json
# Fallback Google AI Studio (hanya jika VERTEX_PROJECT_ID kosong):
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key
# Untuk APK/Capacitor: AI lewat proxy /api/v1/me/ai/gemini-* di server (Vertex atau GEMINI_API_KEY).
# Di server, CORS_ORIGIN harus mencakup origin WebView, mis.: https://well-health.cloud,https://localhost,http://localhost
# Nginx: JSON foto base64 — client_max_body_size 25m; proxy_read/send_timeout 300s; client_body_timeout 300s; send_timeout 300s pada /api/.
# Jika domain pakai Cloudflare (orange cloud), timeout ke origin sering ~100s — analisis AI bisa putus; coba DNS only atau subdomain API tanpa proxy.
# Debug: di server/.env set LOG_GEMINI_REQUESTS=1 lalu lihat log Node saat upload dari APK (jika baris [gemini-food] muncul, request sudah sampai Node).

# --- Strava OAuth (server/.env) ---
# Buat app di https://www.strava.com/settings/api
# STRAVA_CLIENT_ID=
# STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET=
# STRAVA_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:8787/api/v1/strava/callback
# STRAVA_SCOPES=read,activity:read_all,profile:read_all
# STRAVA_FE_REDIRECT=http://localhost:5173/strava

# --- MCU Postgres via SSH jump host (server/.env) ---
# Live query bcsid.mv_ftw_mcu matched by employee SID. Leave empty to use user_history fallback.
# SSH_HOST=
# SSH_PORT=22
# SSH_USER=ubuntu
# SSH_PKEY=C:\path\to\JumpHostVPC2.pem
# PG_HOST=
# PG_PORT=5432
# PG_SSH_HOST=127.0.0.1
# PG_SSH_LOCAL_PORT=5433
# PG_SSH_DATABASE=
# PG_SSH_USER=
# PG_SSH_PASSWORD=
# MCU_PG_SID_COLUMN=
# MCU_PG_DATE_COLUMN=
